<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Active Aging Partners | Cynthia Jones</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  :root {
    --cream: #FAF7F2;
    --warm-white: #FEFCF9;
    --sand: #E8E0D4;
    --clay: #C4A882;
    --sienna: #9A6E4A;
    --deep: #3D2B1A;
    --charcoal: #2C2C28;
    --muted: #7A7165;
    --accent: #7B5E3E;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    background: var(--warm-white);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem 4rem;
    background: rgba(254,252,249,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sand);
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--deep);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    padding-top: 80px;
  }
  .hero-left {
    background: var(--cream);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 5rem 6rem 6rem;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sienna);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 4.5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--deep);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--sienna);
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 400px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent); }
  .btn-outline {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--deep);
    color: var(--deep);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    margin-left: 1rem;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--deep); color: var(--cream); }

  .hero-right {
    background: var(--sand);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-photo-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #DDD0BF 0%, #C8B99A 100%);
  }
  .hero-photo-figure {
    width: 260px;
    height: 380px;
    background: rgba(61,43,26,0.12);
    border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 60% 60% 0 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hero-photo-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(61,43,26,0.5);
  }
  .hero-stat-bar {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    display: flex;
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .hero-stat {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  }
  .hero-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .hero-stat-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    display: block;
  }
  .hero-stat-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--clay);
    display: block;
  }

  /* INTRO BAND */
  .intro-band {
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 4rem 6rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6rem;
  }
  .intro-quote {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
    flex: 1;
    color: var(--clay);
  }
  .intro-text {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.75);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  /* SECTION BASE */
  section { padding: 6rem 6rem; }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sienna);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--deep);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--sienna); }
  .divider {
    width: 40px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--clay);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ABOUT */
  .about {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 7rem 6rem;
  }
  .about-image {
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    background: var(--sand);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .about-image-inner {
    width: 75%;
    height: 75%;
    background: rgba(196,168,130,0.3);
    border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 50% / 40% 40% 60% 60%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .about-tag {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 2rem;
    right: -1rem;
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    width: 160px;
  }
  .about-tag-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .about-tag-text {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--clay);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .about-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .about-values {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .about-value {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--charcoal);
  }
  .about-value::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--clay);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* SERVICES */
  .services { background: var(--cream); }
  .services-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .services-intro {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 380px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .service-card {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.3s;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .service-card:hover { background: var(--deep); }
  .service-card:hover .service-num,
  .service-card:hover .service-name,
  .service-card:hover .service-desc { color: var(--cream); }
  .service-card:hover .service-line { background: var(--clay); }
  .service-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--clay);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
  }
  .service-line {
    width: 30px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--sand);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .service-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--deep);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .service-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }
  .service-card:hover .service-desc { color: rgba(250,247,242,0.7); }

  /* PROCESS */
  .process { background: var(--warm-white); }
  .process-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .process-step { position: relative; }
  .process-step::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem;
    right: -1.5rem;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--sand);
  }
  .process-step:last-child::after { display: none; }
  .step-circle {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--clay);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .step-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--sienna);
  }
  .step-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--deep);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .step-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .testimonials {
    background: var(--deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    padding: 7rem 6rem;
  }
  .testimonials .section-title { color: var(--cream); }
  .testimonials .section-eyebrow { color: var(--clay); }
  .testimonials .divider { background: var(--clay); }
  .testi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .testi-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,168,130,0.2);
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .testi-quote-mark {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--clay);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }
  .testi-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.75);
    line-height: 1.9;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .testi-name {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--clay);
  }
  .testi-role {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.4);
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta {
    background: var(--cream);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8rem 6rem;
  }
  .cta .section-title { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem; }
  .cta .section-eyebrow { text-align: center; }
  .cta .divider { margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
  .cta-sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0; }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    background: var(--charcoal);
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.5);
    padding: 3rem 6rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .footer-logo {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--cream);
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .footer-links a {
    color: rgba(250,247,242,0.4);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--clay); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a class="nav-logo" href="#">Active Aging Partners</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">Women's Small Business Consulting</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Build the<br>
      business that<br>
      <em>runs itself.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Operational strategy and systems design for women entrepreneurs who are ready to stop improvising and start scaling — with confidence, clarity, and a structure that lasts.
    </p>
    <div>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Work With Me</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn-outline">View Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-right">
    <div class="hero-photo-placeholder">
      <div class="hero-photo-figure">
        <span style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:0.8rem; color:rgba(61,43,26,0.4); letter-spacing:0.1em; text-align:center; padding:1.5rem;">Your photo here</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-bar">
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <span class="hero-stat-num">10+</span>
        <span class="hero-stat-label">Years in Operations</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <span class="hero-stat-num">$200K</span>
        <span class="hero-stat-label">Saved for Clients</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stat">
        <span class="hero-stat-num">183%</span>
        <span class="hero-stat-label">Avg. Growth Achieved</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INTRO BAND -->
<div class="intro-band">
  <p class="intro-quote">"Great businesses aren't built on hustle alone — they're built on systems."</p>
  <p class="intro-text">
    Most women start a business because they're brilliant at what they do. But passion alone doesn't keep the lights on — the back end does. I help women entrepreneurs build the operational foundation that turns their great idea into a great company: clear processes, smart tools, a team structure that scales, and metrics that actually tell you what's working.
  </p>
</div>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="about-image">
    <div class="about-image-inner">Your photo here</div>
    <div class="about-tag">
      <span class="about-tag-num">10+</span>
      <span class="about-tag-text">Years leading operations at scale</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="about-content">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">About Cynthia</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Operations is the work behind the <em>work.</em></h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p class="about-body">
      I'm Cynthia Jones — an operations leader with over a decade of experience building the systems, teams, and support structures that make organizations run. I've led ops at coding bootcamps, online universities, and virtual education programs — always at the intersection of people, process, and technology.
    </p>
    <p class="about-body">
      Now I bring that expertise directly to women who are building businesses of their own. Because the same operational thinking that helped me generate $200K in savings and 183% enrollment growth? It scales all the way down to a business of one — and it changes everything.
    </p>
    <div class="about-values">
      <div class="about-value">Master's in Educational Leadership, Portland State</div>
      <div class="about-value">Former VP of Operations, App Academy</div>
      <div class="about-value">10+ years building from scratch</div>
      <div class="about-value">Based in Atlanta, serving clients nationwide</div>
    </div>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Let's Connect</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section id="services" class="services">
  <div class="services-header">
    <div>
      <p class="section-eyebrow">What I Offer</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Services designed<br>for <em>real businesses.</em></h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="services-intro">
      Whether you're setting up from scratch or cleaning up what you've already built, these engagements are designed to give you a clear path forward — not more overwhelm.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="service-card">
      <span class="service-num">01</span>
      <div class="service-line"></div>
      <p class="service-name">Operations Audit & Roadmap</p>
      <p class="service-desc">A full diagnostic of your business operations — tools, workflows, team structure, and communications — with a prioritized roadmap for what to fix first and how to do it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <span class="service-num">02</span>
      <div class="service-line"></div>
      <p class="service-name">Systems & Process Design</p>
      <p class="service-desc">Custom SOPs, workflow documentation, and tool configuration that replace the improvised chaos with repeatable, teachable systems your whole team can follow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <span class="service-num">03</span>
      <div class="service-line"></div>
      <p class="service-name">Customer Experience Setup</p>
      <p class="service-desc">Design your client-facing experience from first touchpoint to ongoing relationship — onboarding flows, communication templates, support tiers, and retention strategy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <span class="service-num">04</span>
      <div class="service-line"></div>
      <p class="service-name">Team Building & Hiring</p>
      <p class="service-desc">Ready to bring someone on? I help you define the role, build the hiring process, create onboarding documentation, and set performance expectations from day one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <span class="service-num">05</span>
      <div class="service-line"></div>
      <p class="service-name">Metrics & Reporting Setup</p>
      <p class="service-desc">Identify the KPIs that actually matter for your business, then build simple dashboards and check-in rhythms so you always know where you stand — without spending hours in spreadsheets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-card">
      <span class="service-num">06</span>
      <div class="service-line"></div>
      <p class="service-name">VIP Strategy Day</p>
      <p class="service-desc">A focused, single-day intensive where we tackle your biggest operational challenge together. Walk away with a clear plan, custom deliverables, and a 30-day action checklist.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section id="process" class="process">
  <p class="section-eyebrow">How It Works</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">A clear path, from <em>day one.</em></h2>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="process-steps">
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle"><span class="step-num">01</span></div>
      <p class="step-title">Discovery Call</p>
      <p class="step-desc">We spend 45 minutes getting clear on where you are, what's not working, and what kind of support you actually need. No pitch — just real conversation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle"><span class="step-num">02</span></div>
      <p class="step-title">Proposal & Scope</p>
      <p class="step-desc">I put together a custom proposal that matches your situation — not a package designed for someone else's business. You see the investment and outcomes before anything starts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle"><span class="step-num">03</span></div>
      <p class="step-title">Deep Dive & Build</p>
      <p class="step-desc">We work together to map, document, and build your operational systems — with regular check-ins, deliverables you can use immediately, and space for your questions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process-step">
      <div class="step-circle"><span class="step-num">04</span></div>
      <p class="step-title">Hand-Off & Support</p>
      <p class="step-desc">You walk away with everything documented, trained, and ready to use. Optional ongoing support packages available if you want a long-term partner.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<section class="testimonials">
  <p class="section-eyebrow">Client Stories</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Results that <em>speak.</em></h2>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="testi-grid">
    <div class="testi-card">
      <span class="testi-quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
      <p class="testi-text">Before working with Cynthia, I had zero documented processes. Six weeks later, I had a full operations playbook, a client onboarding system, and my first hire trained and running. She doesn't just give advice — she builds things with you.</p>
      <p class="testi-name">Monique T.</p>
      <p class="testi-role">Founder, Wellness Collective</p>
    </div>
